  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Top each piece with tomato sugo (see ingredients) and then sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Cover with a lid or foil so the cheese melts, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b835963fcd98f40aae/step-bc67a700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Slice tomato into thin wedges.\n• Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b835963fcd98f40aae/step-45d8c010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine apple, tomato, carrot, spinach & rocket mix and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b835963fcd98f40aae/step-bacf7420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice chick'n.\n• Divide herby plant-based crumbed parmigiana between plates.\n• Sprinkle over chilli flakes (if using).\n• Serve with apple, tomato and rocket salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b835963fcd98f40aae/step-7318a230.jpg"
    }
  ]
